{
  "id": "lost-water-bottle",
  "title": "尋找遺失的水壺",
  "titleEn": "Finding the Lost Water Bottle",
  "category": "校園生活",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/lost-water-bottle.webp",
    "alt": "體育課結束後，小男孩在教室與操場尋找自己的水壺，老師和同學幫忙協尋，最後在操場邊的木長椅上順利找到藍色小水壺。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo walks into the "
        },
        {
          "text": "classroom",
          "wordIds": [
            "classroom"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " after PE class."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "體育課結束後，Leo 走進教室。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lost-water-bottle/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "b8d6f97b70f1084cff74759c540f6c194b7b4211ff3ff175e766cefb3f27bd3a",
        "sha256": "fa8476153394bfaae2e762a51c7292b15f345b15cee35bdf0715886371f84e79"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He checks his desk, but he cannot "
        },
        {
          "text": "find",
          "wordIds": [
            "find"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " his "
        },
        {
          "text": "water",
          "wordIds": [
            "water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "bottle",
          "wordIds": [
            "bottle"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他檢查了自己的書桌，但找不到他的水壺。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lost-water-bottle/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "dc157e3fba579e7f016048ec573ac476338630a794ebd6ffd91848de8a4fa0b1",
        "sha256": "684f441371d74ea280304199fc61f16436e5bfa9577530fc9343279012567407"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo asks his teacher and friends, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Have you seen my water bottle?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "have-you-seen-my-water-bottle"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 問老師和朋友們：「你有看見我的水壺嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lost-water-bottle/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "1e1d92bf855a3a03facbb443ed7740232dc54214b605b9552992d10ae6468399",
        "sha256": "ac0275274e195cedd29eecea464f309779e6167b7409d37148252b0bc4b0de39"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "His teacher smiles and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where did you leave it?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-did-you-leave-it"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "老師微笑著問：「你把它留在哪裡了？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lost-water-bottle/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "3db81df552249e56761b5937fdfc312ecda359e53c7472be7a4fd0c111e615c9",
        "sha256": "741e168c59aeb8ef18a0bb17b40c3f9accda83387b4ee7fdacafb1a2db584ad6"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo thinks for a moment and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-is-blue-and-small"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blue",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-is-blue-and-small"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "blue"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and small.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-is-blue-and-small"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 想了一下說：「它是藍色而且小小的。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lost-water-bottle/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "7af6e395c750ce70a7e4a660fd31ee20e29abf6c17dcd07805ab9771eda246af",
        "sha256": "0ba603a25ca693d92f4a7b53cfeabbe08cb418cf8575bac1be7346bbf9aab579"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They go back to the playground, and his friend points to a "
        },
        {
          "text": "bench",
          "wordIds": [
            "bench"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們走回操場，他的朋友指著一張長椅。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lost-water-bottle/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "bdb4f2038ad54df36b0d356ae2e940238314013e8cd2c961f82661fbcf50872c",
        "sha256": "cae9585d3a48e22d2b8c28f8819ba6dc64c6f10e9715b0dc5a3d044a2179d048"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo runs over and cheers, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Here it is!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "here-it-is"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 跑過去歡呼：「它在這裡！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lost-water-bottle/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "e9b5a69500937b5543822d84b2f66155247295ca9a1b810221961b4ee8fbabe7",
        "sha256": "88b58664ae2a9d59ac91480ecf7ee56ce53afde156304b8e31efbef2f0940bbb"
      }
    }
  ],
